{% import "_shared.html.j2" as sh %}
<div class="lgd-pilot lgd-agg-page" style="{{ sh.container }}">
{# NO h1 in the body: the Flex default page template injects page.title as the served H1 (verified live 2026-08-09); page.title carries the scheme H1, the long SEO title lives in global.title_tag. #}
{{ sh.header(h1, index_url, brand_line, cycle_label, data_date_h) }}

<div style="{{ sh.callout }}">
  <p style="{{ sh.callout_p }}">As of {{ cycle_label }}, based on <strong>{{ "{:,}".format(total_n) }}</strong> public listings across <strong>{{ n_retailers }}</strong> US retailers (round and oval, 0.90 to 2.50 ct):</p>
</div>

<div style="{{ sh.wrap }}">
<table class="lgd-price-table" style="{{ sh.table }}">
  <thead><tr><th style="{{ sh.th_l }}">Size</th><th style="{{ sh.th_r }}">Median listed price</th><th style="{{ sh.th_r }}">Typical range (10th–90th pct)</th><th style="{{ sh.th_r }}">Median per carat</th><th style="{{ sh.th_r }}">Listings (n)</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for p in carat_points %}
  {% set c = cells[p] %}
  {% set bg = loop.cycle("#fafafa", "#ffffff") %}
  <tr><td style="{{ sh.td(bg) }}font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">{{ p | carat }} carat</td><td style="{{ sh.tdn(bg) }}">{{ c.median | usd }}</td><td style="{{ sh.tdn(bg) }}">{{ c.p10 | usd }} to {{ c.p90 | usd }}</td><td style="{{ sh.tdn(bg) }}">{{ c.median_ppc | usd }}</td><td style="{{ sh.tdn(bg) }}">{{ "{:,}".format(c.n) }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<h2 style="{{ sh.h2s }}">How much does a 1 carat lab grown diamond cost?</h2>
<p style="{{ sh.body_p }}">The median 1 carat lab grown diamond ({{ "%.2f" | format(cells[1.0].lo) }} to {{ "%.2f" | format(cells[1.0].hi) }} ct) listed for <strong>{{ cells[1.0].median | usd }}</strong> in {{ cycle_label }}. Most listings fall between {{ cells[1.0].p10 | usd }} and {{ cells[1.0].p90 | usd }}; color, clarity, and cut grade drive the difference.</p>

<h2 style="{{ sh.h2s }}">How much does a 2 carat lab grown diamond cost?</h2>
<p style="{{ sh.body_p }}">The median 2 carat lab grown diamond listed for <strong>{{ cells[2.0].median | usd }}</strong> in {{ cycle_label }}, with most listings between {{ cells[2.0].p10 | usd }} and {{ cells[2.0].p90 | usd }}. Price per carat rises with size: {{ cells[2.0].median_ppc | usd }}/ct at 2 carats vs {{ cells[1.0].median_ppc | usd }}/ct at 1 carat.</p>

<h2 style="{{ sh.h2s }}">What moves the price?</h2>
<p style="{{ sh.body_p }}">Within a size, listed prices vary severalfold with color, clarity, and cut grade, and the same certified stone is often listed at different prices by different retailers. Per-carat pages with retailer-level medians: see the <a href="/pages/lab-grown-diamond-price-comparison" style="color:#1a1a1a;">price comparison hub</a>.</p>

{{ sh.stat_distinction() }}
{{ sh.loose_stone_note() }}
{{ sh.delist_note(data_date_h, retailer_names) }}
{{ sh.methodology(data_date_h) }}
{{ sh.related(related) }}
{{ sh.footer() }}

<script type="application/ld+json">{{ json_ld | tojson }}</script>
</div>
